WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:04.160
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and now that
Marvel is officially shopping a finished Inhumans

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.180
script around to directors I thought it was
time to do a video.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:10.820
There have been all kinds of rumors about
Agents of SHIELD and Skye having Inhuman parents,

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.450
Vin Diesel teased fans that he might be part
of an Inhumans movie.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.400
And Marvel is making making some Inhumans
roster changes on the Avengers soon.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.460
Since this is my first Inhumans video I’ll
explain their backstory in the comics, and

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:20.689
then talk about what’s going on with the
project at Marvel.

00:00:20.689 --> 00:00:25.679
I will do follow up bonus videos for my favorite
Inhumans characters and stories so be sure

00:00:25.679 --> 00:00:27.099
to subscribe to get those.

00:00:27.099 --> 00:00:30.519
If you haven’t heard about the Inhumans
they’re an offshoot of humanity created

00:00:30.519 --> 00:00:32.480
millions of years ago by the Kree.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:39.290
They experimented on humans during the Kree
Skrull War by exposing primitive homosapiens

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:40.520
to the Terrigen Mists.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.850
The circumstances of why the Kree chose humans
to experiment on is a whole other really interesting

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.280
story I can talk about in another video.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:49.010
But the Kree were trying to create a race
of mutants to use against the Skrulls and

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:54.110
at the same time find a way to further evolve
the Kree species.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:59.380
The Terrigen Mist is a vapor created from
Terrigen Crystals.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:03.730
The Crystals are extremely rare and occur
naturally inside the Earth’s moon.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:09.469
After the Kree started using the mutagenic
properties of the mist on humans the city

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:12.119
of Attilan formed as a place for the new creations
to live.

00:01:12.119 --> 00:01:14.270
The use of the mists is very controversial.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:19.330
The process of terrigenesis, exposing a human
to the vapor can have very volatile results.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.450
Sometimes a person can emerge hideously deformed.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:26.351
So as the Kree started experimenting more,
they implemented a selective breeding program

00:01:26.351 --> 00:01:29.189
to weed out the more negative mutations.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:33.369
That’s why some of the Inhumans like Black
Bolt look normal and some like Gorgon, his

00:01:33.369 --> 00:01:35.360
sister, have their appearance radically altered.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:40.049
The mists do that, it’s a random thing that
happens when they’re exposed.

00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:43.210
Not all Inhumans choose to expose themselves
to the mist, there are just normal non-powered

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:44.210
Inhumans living in Attlian.

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:46.310
Taking in the mists is like a rite of passage.

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:47.850
Like becoming a warrior in tribal cultures.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:51.090
Originally they first appeared in the Fantastic
Four comics in 1965.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:55.909
They were created by Stan Lee and Jack Kirby.

00:01:55.909 --> 00:02:02.329
So when we finally see the movie you can bet
that Stan Lee will have a cameo.

00:02:02.329 --> 00:02:05.380
They have a very rigid caste structure.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:09.970
Once someone is exposed to the mists they
are assigned a place in the Inhumans’ society

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:11.269
in the city of Attilan.

00:02:11.269 --> 00:02:12.640
They only have the one city.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.810
Think of it like the ancient chinese imperial
city.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:17.959
Where for most of history no one was allowed
in.

00:02:17.959 --> 00:02:20.190
It was like a sacred self-contained city.

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:25.319
Attilan’s location has been moved a few
times and most recently it was cloaked above

00:02:25.319 --> 00:02:28.200
the earth’s surface during the Infinity
Storyline last year.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:32.549
The most famous Inhuman’s characters are
the Royal Family, remember, very traditional

00:02:32.549 --> 00:02:33.930
caste structure.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:39.909
Black Bolt is King, his wife is Medusa, then
the rest of their family is Crystal, Gorgon,

00:02:39.909 --> 00:02:43.420
Karnak, Luna, Lockjaw and Triton.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:45.920
Usually when you see the covers of their comics
it’s one of those characters.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.689
Black Bolt is the character Vin Diesel is
rumored to be playing.

00:02:49.689 --> 00:02:52.450
He was born as Blackagar Boltagon.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.311
His parents were two of Attilan’s smartest
geneticists.

00:02:54.311 --> 00:02:55.311
Remember, selective breeding.

00:02:55.311 --> 00:02:56.810
They were the head of the ruling council.

00:02:56.810 --> 00:03:00.319
Black Bolt was exposed to the terrigen mists
while he was still an embryo.

00:03:00.319 --> 00:03:04.860
He ended up developing powers that went way
beyond what normal Inhumans develop.

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.700
His biggest power is the sonic scream.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:11.770
That’s the one they show off the most, but
he also has the ability to manipulate energy.

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:15.690
The speech center of his brain produces an
unknown particle that allows him to create

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.640
mentally controlled phenomena.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:21.799
The reason his scream is so powerful is because
the particle he produces interacts with his

00:03:21.799 --> 00:03:25.360
speech creating massive distortions in space.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:29.800
So it’s not really his voice that destroys
people, his vocal cords produce an energy

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:33.280
distortion, visually they just make it look
like a super powerful banshee wail.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:34.700
But that’s not really what’s going on.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:38.050
Thus he’s not the chatty character Deadpool
is.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:41.250
The little fork apparatus on top of his head
helps him control his power.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:45.640
He can use his power to fortify himself, he
can use it to fly and he can project it like

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:46.640
a strike.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.330
There’s a bunch more cool stuff he can do.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:51.950
Think of him as a cooler version of magneto
with the way he manipulates energy.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:56.830
He along with the rest of the Royal family
have a certain amount of telepathy.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:01.700
Because he can’t speak easily he usually
communicates his wishes to his wife Medusa

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:05.299
telepathically and she speaks as his translator.

00:04:05.299 --> 00:04:07.739
Each Inhuman has vastly different powers.

00:04:07.739 --> 00:04:10.400
Medusa as the name implies has very interesting
hair.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:15.250
It has the tensile strength of steel and she
can control each strand of it independently.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:18.370
She uses it to thrash people around or immobilize
them.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:27.530
She can also throw heavy stuff around with
it when she’s anchored to the ground.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:33.550
Triton has a lot of aquatic based powers,
Lockjaw is a dog who was exposed to the mists

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:35.840
and developed the ability to teleport.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:40.900
He also has a lot of dog-related powers.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.620
He can ingest an infinite amount of matter
of all kinds.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:47.680
He has super smell and empathic abilities
that enable him to sense if people are in

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.620
trouble a long ways away.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:56.000
Black Bolt has a mad Brother named Maximus,
as in crazy mad.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:05:00.009
He’s like the Loki to Black Bolt’s Thor,
always plotting to overthrow him.

00:05:00.009 --> 00:05:02.169
Maximus’ powers are mostly psonic.

00:05:02.169 --> 00:05:05.720
As in mind control.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:14.729
Right now at Marvel Studios Kevin Feige and
the powers that be are really open to doing

00:05:14.729 --> 00:05:15.860
an Inhumans project.

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:19.830
They have a finished script that they’re
using to attract directors.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.220
Once they find a director, that person will
probably re-write the script.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:27.401
But because things are just getting going,
it’s likely that we won’t see an Inhumans

00:05:27.401 --> 00:05:29.870
movie until 2017 or 2018.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:35.980
As for Agents of SHIELD.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:43.050
Skye was teased as an inhuman just because
of the connection to the Kree soldier in TAHITI

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:47.450
and her resistance to Kree blood.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:51.590
That hasn’t been confirmed or anything,
but they just hired Kyle Maclachan to play

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:54.370
her father and he’s not going to be wearing
blue makeup.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.930
Thus, I say Inhuman is a better theory.

00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:03.620
Plus in the comics most recently, the inhumans
have been on earth.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:08.919
It’s also possible that Marvel could revise
the backstories of Quicksilver and Scarlet

00:06:08.919 --> 00:06:12.069
Witch and instead of mutants, make them Inhumans.

00:06:12.069 --> 00:06:17.470
Just because of the copyright issue with Fox
and X-Men.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:22.889
Vin Diesel teasing an Inhumans movie is also
a recent thing.

00:06:22.889 --> 00:06:24.659
Here’s his quote:

00:06:24.659 --> 00:06:28.630
When I first got the call from Kevin Feige,
he prefaced the call by saying ‘This is

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.660
the strangest character Marvel has ever attempted.’

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:36.850
He said ‘Don’t answer me now, but instead
of making the fans wait until 2017, there’s

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:40.440
something that would be a brilliant idea,
we think you could be the only person who

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:43.259
could bring the emotion to this very challenging
task.

00:06:43.259 --> 00:06:47.530
Don’t answer me Vin, don’t answer me,
let me send over my conceptual art.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:52.750
Fiege was talking about Groot when he said
not making fans wait till 2017.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.530
But what’s the 2017 thing?

00:06:54.530 --> 00:07:00.500
In an earlier interview, he said that he was
up for new IP, intellectual property in 2017.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.130
So he wasn’t talking about Guardians.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.210
Then he also posted this picture recently:

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.280
This was posted August 9th.

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:11.000
So he’s joking about Guardians, but he could
also be teasing Inhumans.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:18.389
Vin Diesel is attractive to Marvel for a number
of reasons, he’s a great actor and he has

00:07:18.389 --> 00:07:20.030
a very large personal audience.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:22.860
He has one of the largest facebook pages in
the world.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:23.940
82 Million fans.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:29.449
No matter how big he is, Marvel would never
let him spoil anything, but they could allow

00:07:29.449 --> 00:07:38.310
him to have some fun teasing ideas just because
the response he gets is so big and so immediate.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:42.480
The next Inhumans videos I’m planning are
my favorite stories and my favorite characters.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:46.780
So I’ll try to post those in the next couple
of days before I do more Doctor Who.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:47.780
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

